Subject: Boot file in the firmware folder of the build, on the Classic

The build's configure script also writes the firmware folder under the name
FIRMWARE_DIR. On the Classic the boot file lives in that folder: the
bootloader looks there first, then in the folder of older installs, then at
the root, and the firmware watches that folder for a new boot file. Every
model keeps its old search when its folders are the same. The legal texts and
the games that wrote the old folder in their paths use FIRMWARE_DIR, and the
message shown when the folder is missing no longer names it.

